<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Coles' gearing &quot;above normal&quot; - Clark.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Coles' gearing &quot;above normal&quot; - Clark.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailer Coles Myer Ltd has a higher gearing level than was normal and appropriate for the company, chairman Nobby Clark said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It's above what we'd regard as being normal and appropriate for this company, but it's hardly at dangerous levels,&quot; he told the annual meeting when asked about the company's net gearing ratio which stood at 63.6 percent at its July 28 balance date.</p>
</text>
